---
type Props = {
	demoUrl: string;
};

const { demoUrl } = Astro.props;
---

<section id="demo" class="section demo">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="grid grid--2 demo-inner">
			<div class="copy">
				<span class="eyebrow">Demo</span>
				<h2 class="h2">Mira cómo se verá tu tienda</h2>
				<p class="lead">
					Prueba el flujo completo como cliente: elige productos, arma el pedido y ve cómo se envía a WhatsApp con el
					detalle y el total.
				</p>

				<div class="demo-actions">
					<a class="btn btn-primary" href={demoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Abrir demo</a>
					<span class="pill">Sin plan gratis: mira la demo</span>
				</div>

				<div class="note">
					<span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
					<span>La demo es un ejemplo. Tu tienda tendrá su propio enlace para compartir.</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="preview" aria-label="Vista previa">
				<div class="preview-top">
					<span class="preview-chip">Catálogo</span>
					<span class="preview-chip">Carrito</span>
					<span class="preview-chip">WhatsApp</span>
				</div>
				<div class="preview-body">
					<div class="preview-grid" aria-label="Productos">
						<div class="preview-item">
							<img class="preview-img" src="/landing_demo/hamburguesa.webp" alt="Hamburguesa" loading="lazy" />
						</div>
						<div class="preview-item">
							<img class="preview-img" src="/landing_demo/salchipapa.jpg" alt="Salchipapa" loading="lazy" />
						</div>
						<div class="preview-item">
							<img class="preview-img" src="/landing_demo/broster.avif" alt="Broster" loading="lazy" />
						</div>
						<div class="preview-item">
							<img class="preview-img" src="/landing_demo/Hot_dog.png" alt="Hot dog" loading="lazy" />
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="preview-cta">Enviar pedido por WhatsApp</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.demo {
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.07));
	}

	.demo-inner {
		align-items: center;
	}

	.copy {
		max-width: 560px;
	}

	.demo-actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 12px;
		margin-top: 18px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.note {
		margin-top: 14px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.dot {
		width: 10px;
		height: 10px;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.8);
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(29, 185, 84, 0.14);
	}

	.preview {
		border-radius: 20px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
		background: var(--surface);
		overflow: hidden;
		max-width: 560px;
		margin-left: auto;
	}

	.preview-top {
		display: flex;
		gap: 10px;
		padding: 14px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
	}

	.preview-chip {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 8px 12px;
		border-radius: 999px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		color: var(--muted);
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 13px;
	}

	.preview-body {
		padding: 16px;
	}

	.preview-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 10px;
		grid-auto-rows: 96px;
	}

	.preview-item {
		border-radius: 16px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		background: var(--surface);
		overflow: hidden;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
		height: 96px;
	}

	.preview-img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: center;
	}

	.preview-cta {
		margin-top: 12px;
		border-radius: 16px;
		padding: 14px 14px;
		text-align: center;
		color: #fff;
		font-weight: 900;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--brand), var(--brand-strong));
	}

	@media (max-width: 920px) {
		.preview {
			margin-left: 0;
		}
	}
</style>
